; DOS U preset: Laura Bow 2 (The Dagger of Amon-Ra), Korean EUC-KR fan patch
; (2014, based on the English DOS CD). Modelled on LB1KOU.MAP (same legacy
; EUC-KR path). The legacy (EUC-KR) text path uses singleFace(), the first
; face only, so only KO2350G.SVF (NanumGothic-Bold, 16 px, 2 bpp, ASCII +
; ksx1001-nohanja, one baseline in a 16x16 cell - bake-dos-fonts.sh) is
; active here, for every font id; the body face KO2350B.SVF needs a UTF-8
; translation (see KQ1KOU.MAP), which this patch is not. Characters
; KO2350G.SVF lacks draw U+25A1. align=cell: the 16-row glyph sits on the
; 16-row line with no offset, nothing above or below it for the game to
; leave behind when it erases the line. rgb_rendering=true (scummvm.ini) is
; what makes this render truecolor/antialiased; alpha= below is
; documentation only, SCI ignores it (spec 4.5).
;
; Canonical location (common2350-brief, 2026-09-29): moved here from
; harness/dos/release/lb2/ - the harness's LB2 build script now reads it
; from dists instead. KO2350G.SVF replaces the old KOCP949.SVF (full
; 11172-syllable cp949): the coverage gate found LB2's translation needs 7
; code points outside the 2350 (KS X 1001 extension Hangul syllables, e.g.
; U+AC37/U+D59D), folded into KO2350G.SVF's own bake (bake-dos-fonts.sh,
; EXTRA_REQUIRE) rather than left to draw U+25A1.
[hires]
scale=2
alpha=true
face=ko
missing=u+25a1
align=cell

[fonts]
ko=KO2350G.SVF

[latin]
mode=proportional
metrics=font
